{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once again, it's late at night, and you open up your backlog folder. You choose ten games and start playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ten Deadly Games is a collection of games from different developers\u00a0based around the same theme - &quot;Death is an Opportunity.&quot; Experience slow-burn horror in &quot;D.I.M.&quot;, score-based physics mayhem in &quot;Fishin' Critical&quot;, puzzle challenges in &quot;More for Me,&quot; a bittersweet narrative in &quot;Until Then&quot;,\u00a0and more! Ten Deadly Games is a celebration of the variety and creativity of indie game developers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dead Man's Draw</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A western-themed FPS in which dying gives you a chance to progress to new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grim Was the Acre</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A humorous character sketch with lots of witty dialogue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hoping for a Home</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200bA slow-paced and surprisingly heartfelt puzzle game about a goblin finding the homes of deceased humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Organ Donor Delivery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200bA game about goofy, fast-paced optimization while you're trying to box and deliver organs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mitten's Descent</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200bA quick and addictive rougelike-platformer hybrid about dodging threats and upgrading when you fail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More for Me</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200bA cute and clever side-scrolling puzzle game about using your lives to create opportunities to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>D.I.M.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200bA\u00a0slow-burn and thought-provoking horror game about interacting with a very concerning AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishin' Critical\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200bA sloppy and silly score-cruncher about a fish trying to steal items off of a fishing boat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Until Then</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200bA bittersweet look into the thoughts of a dying individual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grave Intentions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A goofy game about wooing a woman at her relative's funeral.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"DIM Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1410450/8c66fda4893e93885abb4147af17035152629f8b.jpg"},{"name":"Dead Man's Draw Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1410450/60784eb6b4ecb14d0ba6f1fdef60a41b12f19d4b.jpg"},{"name":"Fishin' Critical Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1410450/248c1ebf65234d6fbf37bc2d165b7e596d115e4c.jpg"},{"name":"Grave Intentions Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1410450/30f528535f6f2fe6fea64e9535a1e9f66b4fc27f.jpg"},{"name":"Grim Was the Acre Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1410450/14490d4a4c2ab078098de466f8c76a64b96dec0f.jpg"},{"name":"Hoping for a Home Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1410450/744b69fd6234b485877f4bea3040510607eaeb1c.jpg"},{"name":"Mitten's Descent Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1410450/bed9099919ca0dd2cb5fa165313428bee7e4f349.jpg"},{"name":"More for Me Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1410450/cd5bf36707bac6080ec09a2e8136b8a1d2ff2211.jpg"},{"name":"Organ Donor Delivery Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/im