ance to progress to new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grim Was the Acre</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A humorous character sketch with lots of witty dialogue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hoping for a Home</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200bA slow-paced and surprisingly heartfelt puzzle game about a goblin finding the homes of deceased humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Organ Donor Delivery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200bA game about goofy, fast-paced optimization while you're trying to box and deliver organs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mitten's Descent</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200bA quick and addictive rougelike-platformer hybrid about dodging threats and upgrading when you fail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More for Me</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200bA cute and clever side-scrolling puzzle game about using your lives to create opportunities to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>D.I.M.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200bA\u00a0slow-burn and thought-provoking horror game about interacting with a very concerning AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishin' Critical\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200bA sloppy and silly score-cruncher about a fish trying to steal items off of a fishing boat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Until Then</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200bA bittersweet look into the thoughts of a dying individual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grave Intentions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A goofy game about wooing a woman at her relative's funeral.</p>","developers":["Ducky Dev","Blahzors","Schlopp","FYRE Games","Cody Reader","BrainError","xMorrow","Cornettu","Lex Heilling","AVeryShinyCoin","Gizmo199","SurffingBird","OzMaister","inner.demons.team","Lucy Dean","Mattes Clarke","Quinn Dymalski","Silas Barber","raiden23771","Pozzo","vvetiver","amaybus","chickenempress"